# AIPOS-240 r2 (F-o3-20): anchored — ONLY the repo-root audit-card dir. The unanchored form
# also swallowed tools/aipos_cli/tests/fixtures/task_cards/ (fixtures were never tracked →
# every fresh clone failed 4 tests; dev trees were false-green via local untracked files).
/task_cards/

.codex/
.codex

._*
node_modules/
playwright-report/
test-results/
.lybra/local/
# AIPOS-271: login trail (runtime; may carry source IPs — not a truth-repo artifact)
.lybra/auth-log.jsonl
# F-271-6: remember secret (server-side signing key for long-lived cookies)
.lybra/remember_secret
# AIPOS-F22B (R6K 止血): .lybra/ 为 gate 运行态目录, 含凭据与角色文件, 不入产品仓 (历史已含 token, Owner 裁定止血+记账不轮换)
.lybra/

# AIPOS-272 FIX-3: board 多工作区配置(部署物,不入产品代码树)
web/board/.board_config.json

# disposable npm pack build artifacts (re-packed per release)
*.tgz

# AIPOS-333: deploy snapshots (gate runs from .deploy/current, not working tree)
.deploy/
5_tasks/

# AIPOS-R5A: worktree 目录=生成物不入库 (Owner 红线⑤)
.worktrees/
